# CONFIG SLOT ACTIVATE type=filter slot=9     <- when the slot has been checked
# Written off (state=off):
#   Never to the blocklist (floating) 2: references 'Geo_block': an alias of type 'geoip' (the countries of a GeoIP database), whose addresses are not in the configuration; 'Geo_block' holds members only its platform knows
#   Guests never to the blocklist: not converted: it matches the source of traffic that leaves, which is the source after outbound NAT
#   DMZ ICMPv6: an ICMPv6 type: the target writes ICMPv6 as a protocol only
#   Servers fetch updates: 'Updates' holds members only its platform knows
#   Servers fetch updates 3: 'Updates' holds members only its platform knows
#   Guests interactive (tos): not converted: it matches the type of service (tos) '0x10'
